        "created_at": "2014-04-19T09:23:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just for the record I had and excellent finish last night against Voss thanks to both Parse and Mr. Fixer, Voss had 5 minions out and 9hp, my heroes were pretty much dead villain turn but thanks to a combination of Parse's Between the Lines (one hero may use a power now, if it deals damage then that damage is irreducable) and Mr. Fixer's Riveting Crane we were able to make Voss's DR vanish and beat him into oblivion without worrying about the minions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Yes it was situational, it'll probably never happen again, but it was awesome when I realised it was going to work and win me the game.</p>",
